  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 517.04 Design and Construction Requirements for Trail and Pathway Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 517.04 Design and Construction Requirements for Trail and Pathway Projects. A proposed trail or pathway project shall be designed and constructed to:\n\n(a) Use existing structures and pathways wherever practicable;\n\n(b) Maintain pathways no more than 20 feet wide; and\n\n(c) For trails, comply with the Trail BMPs, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19; amd by #12954, eff 12-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
